    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "is an equilibrium point, as F(0) = 0. If (8) holds then the origin is globally asymptotically stable for all closedloop systems obtained by interconnecting any system (A,B) ∈ Σ with the controller u = K(x)."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
