    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 1.0]",
    "content" : "K(x) = Y (x)PZ(x), where Y ∈ Rm×p[x], P ∈ Sp is positive deﬁnite, and Z ∈ Rp[x] is radially unbounded satisfying"
